WEBVTT

00:28.310 --> 00:31.760
<b>Ericht! Please! Don't do this!</b>

00:32.280 --> 00:34.430
<b>Then don't get in Mom's way.</b>

00:35.950 --> 00:39.100
<b>This is all for Ericht's sake...</b>

00:39.100 --> 00:41.220
<b>so why did you come here?</b>

00:41.920 --> 00:43.890
<b>Go back to the school with your friends.</b>

00:44.630 --> 00:49.690
<b>This is a matter for those of us
who can only live inside the data storm.</b>

00:49.690 --> 00:51.440
<b>So, Suletta...</b>

00:51.440 --> 00:53.580
<b>You must give up.</b>

00:54.010 --> 00:55.500
<b>No!</b>

00:55.500 --> 00:59.670
<b>I can't turn a blind eye to you guys!</b>

01:00.430 --> 01:03.670
<b>You're so stubborn, Suletta.</b>

01:10.840 --> 01:12.050
<b>Stop it, Lauda!</b>

01:12.050 --> 01:14.890
<b><i>Why are you trying to attack that ship?!</i></b>

01:15.240 --> 01:16.470
<b><i>What about you, Brother...</i></b>

01:16.950 --> 01:19.970
<b>Why are you by that woman's side?</b>

01:19.970 --> 01:21.560
<b>Lauda?</b>

01:22.290 --> 01:25.530
<b><i>If Miorine hadn't brought Gundams
back into the world,</i></b>

01:25.960 --> 01:27.390
<b><i>Petra wouldn't have...!</i></b>

01:34.010 --> 01:36.720
<b>Why the heck is Lauda attacking us?!</b>

01:36.720 --> 01:38.120
<b>How should I know?!</b>

01:39.330 --> 01:40.920
<b>Ms. Felsi!</b>

01:41.490 --> 01:43.080
<b>We'll be caught up in the mess.</b>

01:43.080 --> 01:44.330
<b>Nika! Chuchu!</b>

01:44.330 --> 01:44.910
<b>Roger!</b>

01:44.910 --> 01:47.460
<b>Let's go, Demi Barding!</b>

01:54.400 --> 01:58.980
<b>Permet communications will be useless
within data storm space.</b>

01:58.980 --> 02:01.010
<b>Change to optical wireless communications.</b>

02:01.010 --> 02:04.860
<b>Right... Demi Barding,
now terminating Permet link.</b>

02:15.650 --> 02:17.240
<b>We're gonna die!</b>

02:17.240 --> 02:19.080
<b>We're all gonna die!</b>

02:19.080 --> 02:21.250
<b>Mommy!</b>

02:24.100 --> 02:26.190
<b>S-Sorry, everybody!</b>

02:26.190 --> 02:31.130
<b>Is piloting without Permet
really this hard?!</b>

02:34.860 --> 02:38.180
<b>Is this... the data storm?</b>

02:38.700 --> 02:41.640
<b>This sensation is so unpleasant.</b>

02:41.640 --> 02:44.230
<b>Hurry up and get us to Quiet Zero!</b>

02:44.230 --> 02:46.560
<b><i>Who put you in charge, loudmouth!</i></b>

02:48.750 --> 02:52.020
<b>Episode 23</b>

04:30.160 --> 04:31.120
<b>Don't!</b>

04:31.120 --> 04:34.750
<b><i>The Schwarzette...
the Gundam will take your life!</i></b>

04:34.750 --> 04:38.090
<b><i>Then why don't you stop me by killing me?</i></b>

04:38.090 --> 04:39.550
<b><i>Just like Dad?!</i></b>

04:41.570 --> 04:42.840
<b>Answer me, Brother!</b>

04:43.670 --> 04:46.680
<b>Why didn't you tell me about Dad?</b>

04:46.680 --> 04:48.720
<b>Was it out of guilt?</b>

04:49.210 --> 04:52.430
<b><i>Or did you think
I couldn't bear the burden?</i></b>

04:56.460 --> 04:59.690
<b><i>Am I really that undependable?</i></b>

04:59.690 --> 05:01.280
<b><i>That's not it.</i></b>

05:01.280 --> 05:03.400
<b><i>What happened to Dad was my sin alone.</i></b>

05:03.400 --> 05:06.410
<b>I'm the one who should bear it all!</b>

05:07.240 --> 05:09.910
<b><i>That's what's wrong with you, Brother...</i></b>

05:12.350 --> 05:17.170
<b><i>That's how Miorine takes advantage
of you, and why you cling to her!</i></b>

05:20.740 --> 05:24.090
<b>That righteousness... That arrogance...</b>

05:24.570 --> 05:26.770
<b><i>That's your sin!</i></b>

05:35.210 --> 05:37.310
<b>A small craft is approaching.</b>

05:37.310 --> 05:39.900
<b>It has a Benerit Group registration code.</b>

05:39.900 --> 05:41.910
<b>It's emitting a communication signal.</b>

05:41.910 --> 05:43.690
<b>It's alone?</b>

05:43.690 --> 05:45.030
<b>I'll talk to them.</b>

05:46.260 --> 05:49.750
<b><i>This is Guston Parche,
a Space Assembly League inspector.</i></b>

05:49.750 --> 05:51.370
<b><i>I'd like to speak to operation HQ.</i></b>

05:51.850 --> 05:54.630
<b>What can an inspector do
in this situation?</b>

05:55.190 --> 05:59.010
<b><i>The corporate governance
is still intact with our group.</i></b>

06:01.690 --> 06:03.500
<b>Delling Rembran?</b>

06:04.200 --> 06:07.520
<b>In accordance with the League Charter,</b>

06:07.520 --> 06:11.770
<b>we request the convening
of an emergency special session.</b>

06:11.770 --> 06:13.720
<b><i>A special session?</i></b>

06:14.250 --> 06:17.030
<b>Have all members
send their representatives</b>

06:17.030 --> 06:21.780
<b>and reconsider if it was justifiable
to intervene in our group's affairs.</b>

06:26.130 --> 06:27.190
<b>Mr. President...</b>

06:27.190 --> 06:29.900
<b>I'm grateful... for your cooperation.</b>

06:39.610 --> 06:41.330
<b>Stand down, Suletta.</b>

06:41.820 --> 06:44.680
<b>I don't want to hurt you.</b>

06:47.530 --> 06:50.550
<b>Neither... do I!</b>

06:50.550 --> 06:52.680
<b>Then don't stop us.</b>

06:52.680 --> 06:57.570
<b>Mom wants Eri to...
have a place in the world.</b>

06:58.580 --> 07:01.650
<b>Is it okay to gobble up
all these fronts for that goal?</b>

07:02.670 --> 07:04.190
<b><i>To take lives?!</i></b>

07:04.190 --> 07:06.910
<b>Eri wouldn't do that.</b>

07:07.340 --> 07:12.180
<b>But if they get in our way,
Mom won't hesitate!</b>

07:12.180 --> 07:14.920
<b><i>That's why I want to stop her!</i></b>

07:14.920 --> 07:19.170
<b><i>I don't want Mom...
to become some evil magician!</i></b>

07:27.530 --> 07:28.880
<b>Please, Suletta...</b>

07:28.880 --> 07:30.760
<b>Forget about us.</b>

07:33.700 --> 07:34.680
<b>No!</b>

07:36.870 --> 07:37.850
<b><i>I...</i></b>

07:38.670 --> 07:40.520
<b><i>I care about you!</i></b>

07:40.520 --> 07:42.900
<b>And Mom, too!</b>

07:44.050 --> 07:46.010
<b><i>When Mom cries,</i></b>

07:47.090 --> 07:48.940
<b><i>I want to be there to hug her!</i></b>

07:49.590 --> 07:50.990
<b><i>I want to be by her side!</i></b>

07:51.890 --> 07:53.160
<b>There's no way...</b>

07:54.140 --> 07:55.870
<b><i>I could ever forget!</i></b>

07:59.810 --> 08:01.630
<b>What a pity.</b>

08:10.160 --> 08:11.340
<b>We're surrounded.</b>

08:11.830 --> 08:13.880
<b>Ms. Miorine! Everyone!</b>

08:14.370 --> 08:16.930
<b>If you don't understand, Suletta...</b>

08:17.580 --> 08:19.140
<b>than I won't hesitate, either.</b>

08:20.330 --> 08:21.350
<b>Ericht!</b>

08:27.670 --> 08:29.400
<b>Please!</b>

08:29.400 --> 08:31.240
<b><i>Stop it, Ericht!</i></b>

08:49.750 --> 08:51.550
<b>The mobile suits...</b>

08:52.030 --> 08:54.130
<b>...stopped?</b>

08:54.130 --> 08:55.890
<b>What just happened?</b>

08:55.890 --> 08:57.390
<b>Chuchu! Nika!</b>

08:57.390 --> 08:58.980
<b><i>Okay!</i></b>

09:01.620 --> 09:02.940
<b>Why?</b>

09:02.940 --> 09:04.180
<b>Why do you interfere?</b>

09:04.670 --> 09:07.100
<b>The data storm can make
our wishes come true!</b>

09:08.380 --> 09:09.270
<b>Huh?</b>

09:10.720 --> 09:11.780
<b><i>What caused it?</i></b>

09:11.780 --> 09:14.610
<b><i>Data interference is occurring.</i></b>

09:14.610 --> 09:17.410
<b><i>The data storm's information density
is degrading.</i></b>

09:18.220 --> 09:19.200
<b>Where are you going?</b>

09:22.880 --> 09:24.710
<b>To do pest control.</b>

09:25.690 --> 09:30.540
<b>Captain, Assembly League HQ
is calling on a secure line.</b>

09:32.240 --> 09:37.730
<b>Lagrange 1 has an interplanetary
laser power transmission system.</b>

09:37.730 --> 09:39.970
<b>We'd like you to use it.</b>

09:40.460 --> 09:43.690
<b><i>What about the special session
that Delling requested?</i></b>

09:43.690 --> 09:47.690
<b><i>We've received no such request.</i></b>

09:48.210 --> 09:49.750
<b>An interplanetary weapon</b>

09:49.750 --> 09:54.070
<b>developed under the guise
of a power transmission system...</b>

09:54.590 --> 09:59.490
<b>L1 Interplanetary Laser Transmission System 
"ILTS"</b>

09:54.890 --> 09:59.490
<b>I wonder, what if it were
to be mistakenly activated?</b>

09:59.490 --> 10:01.290
<b>If we use that thing,</b>

10:01.290 --> 10:05.380
<b>it'll devastate not just Benerit
but all of Lagrange 4.</b>

10:05.380 --> 10:07.540
<b>Who'll take responsibility?</b>

10:07.540 --> 10:10.130
<b><i>We will, of course.</i></b>

10:11.190 --> 10:13.850
<b>To make up for
the Assembly League's blunder,</b>

10:13.850 --> 10:18.510
<b>I imagine Lagrange 1's sovereign
government and corporate volunteers</b>

10:18.510 --> 10:21.770
<b>will lead the rebuilding efforts.</b>

10:21.770 --> 10:25.020
<b>And when the arbitration is over,</b>

10:25.020 --> 10:30.190
<b>you promise that our company
will be in control of the Group.</b>

10:43.780 --> 10:46.430
<b>Let's go. Follow me.</b>

10:48.370 --> 10:51.690
<b>The data storm seems calmer in here.</b>

10:51.690 --> 10:53.460
<b>Thank goodness!</b>

10:57.830 --> 10:59.320
<b>Take this.</b>

10:59.920 --> 11:02.070
<b>You've had training, haven't you?</b>

11:02.070 --> 11:03.920
<b>I could never--</b>

11:03.920 --> 11:06.780
<b>I can't very well hand it to a student.</b>

11:09.220 --> 11:12.520
<b>Okay! Let's go punch in
that shutdown code.</b>

11:12.520 --> 11:15.000
<b>W-Wait, Chuchu!</b>

11:18.560 --> 11:19.880
<b>A Haro?</b>

11:19.880 --> 11:21.800
<b>Intruders will be eliminated.</b>

11:29.610 --> 11:30.790
<b>So this is...</b>

11:31.530 --> 11:33.270
<b><i>a Gundam?</i></b>

11:34.450 --> 11:36.750
<b>With this, I'm a match for my brother!</b>

11:38.170 --> 11:40.400
<b>I can stop him!</b>

11:40.880 --> 11:42.880
<b><i>I can stop the witches...</i></b>

11:42.880 --> 11:44.850
<b>and Miorine!</b>

11:44.850 --> 11:47.560
<b><i>Lauda! Why don't you quit this?!</i></b>

11:47.560 --> 11:48.720
<b>Any further, and--</b>

11:48.720 --> 11:51.550
<b>It's you who should wake up, Brother!</b>

11:58.400 --> 12:00.900
<b><i>The crime of killing our father,</i></b>

12:00.900 --> 12:03.740
<b><i>the crime of wounding Petra...</i></b>

12:03.740 --> 12:07.410
<b>If you won't make that woman pay for it...</b>

12:07.410 --> 12:09.350
<b>You're wrong! Listen to me, Lauda!</b>

12:09.350 --> 12:13.080
<b><i>I will defend the honor
of the Jeturk name!</i></b>

12:14.620 --> 12:18.190
<b><i>In place of my brother,
who is in thrall to a witch,</i></b>

12:18.190 --> 12:21.380
<b><i>I will shoulder all of their sins!</i></b>

12:21.380 --> 12:25.260
<b>I will... Lauda Jeturk will...!</b>

12:37.680 --> 12:39.670
<b>You're Lauda?</b>

12:49.820 --> 12:51.390
<b>I'm Guel.</b>

12:51.390 --> 12:53.460
<b>Now I have a little brother!</b>

12:53.460 --> 12:55.430
<b>I'm super happy.</b>

13:06.170 --> 13:07.650
<b><i>Brother...?</i></b>

13:09.010 --> 13:11.160
<b><i>You're right.</i></b>

13:11.760 --> 13:13.060
<b><i>About Dad...</i></b>

13:14.760 --> 13:16.770
<b>If everyone...</b>

13:16.770 --> 13:18.370
<b>If you...</b>

13:18.720 --> 13:21.630
<b>can't forgive me, I...</b>

13:24.600 --> 13:27.170
<b><i>Brother! Run!</i></b>

13:27.170 --> 13:30.240
<b><i>I'll... never run again.</i></b>

13:30.700 --> 13:33.510
<b><i>From Dad or from you.</i></b>

13:34.610 --> 13:35.850
<b><i>So at least...</i></b>

13:38.240 --> 13:41.900
<b>Don't go piloting a Gundam anymore.</b>

13:44.710 --> 13:47.290
<b>I'm sorry, Brother...</b>

13:49.510 --> 13:51.140
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

13:56.510 --> 13:58.830
<b><i>Just how stupid are you two?!</i></b>

13:58.830 --> 13:59.830
<b><i>Felsi?!</i></b>

13:59.830 --> 14:01.440
<b><i>Dying in a sibling spat?!</i></b>

14:01.440 --> 14:04.280
<b>If that's a joke, it's not funny!</b>

14:08.690 --> 14:10.200
<b>You said it...</b>

14:11.610 --> 14:15.260
<b><i>It really wouldn't... be that funny.</i></b>

14:19.490 --> 14:21.290
<b>Idiot! Lower your head!</b>

14:21.290 --> 14:23.270
<b>Where the hell did you get that?</b>

14:23.270 --> 14:24.630
<b>Hell, who cares?</b>

14:25.790 --> 14:28.650
<b>Ms. Winston, take President Miorine
to the core block!</b>

14:28.650 --> 14:29.510
<b>But...</b>

14:29.510 --> 14:30.950
<b>Go, Miorine!</b>

14:30.950 --> 14:32.600
<b>Go and finish the job!</b>

14:32.600 --> 14:34.850
<b>As quickly as possible, please!</b>

14:42.970 --> 14:44.380
<b>Let's go.</b>

14:44.940 --> 14:48.450
<b>Let me take care of them.
Nobody will get killed this time.</b>

14:49.730 --> 14:52.620
<b>Always rubbing it in...</b>

15:00.120 --> 15:01.120
<b>In here.</b>

15:07.710 --> 15:09.610
<b>Hurry up and shut it down.</b>

15:09.610 --> 15:10.470
<b>I know, okay?</b>

15:13.960 --> 15:15.060
<b>Let me try.</b>

15:17.180 --> 15:18.830
<b>Why?</b>

15:19.180 --> 15:21.330
<b>If that's the emergency shutdown code,</b>

15:21.330 --> 15:23.400
<b>I took the liberty of changing it.</b>

15:24.020 --> 15:26.580
<b>Did you think I was so careless?</b>

15:30.860 --> 15:33.960
<b>Miorine is with Mom now.</b>

15:34.780 --> 15:38.850
<b>If it's to gain one, Mom will...</b>

15:38.850 --> 15:40.220
<b><i>No!</i></b>

15:40.680 --> 15:45.000
<b>Then don't take away the place
where Mom and I can live freely.</b>

15:48.040 --> 15:50.470
<b>Ma'am! Please stop this now!</b>

15:50.470 --> 15:52.110
<b>Why?</b>

15:52.110 --> 15:55.760
<b>Eri is the child blessed
by Vanadis's ideals.</b>

15:56.510 --> 15:59.810
<b>Yet there's no place for her
in this world.</b>

16:00.430 --> 16:02.270
<b>So I'll have to make one.</b>

16:03.010 --> 16:06.400
<b>A place where Eri can be happy.</b>

16:07.140 --> 16:09.210
<b>Eri, Eri...</b>

16:09.210 --> 16:11.150
<b>Don't you care about Suletta at all?</b>

16:11.150 --> 16:12.960
<b>I do love her.</b>

16:12.960 --> 16:15.570
<b>But now she has friends like you.</b>

16:17.030 --> 16:20.670
<b>Can you imagine how Suletta feels
aboard the Calibarn?</b>

16:21.910 --> 16:24.440
<b>She was trembling with fear
that she might die.</b>

16:24.870 --> 16:28.480
<b>But even so,
because she cares for you both...</b>

16:29.170 --> 16:31.090
<b>because she loves you...</b>

16:32.040 --> 16:35.590
<b>If you're a mother,
then love your daughters equally!</b>

16:37.460 --> 16:38.840
<b>That's none of your business...</b>

16:43.180 --> 16:45.710
<b>Hey! Are you trying to
reprogram it or something?</b>

16:45.710 --> 16:47.650
<b>If I can get around the admin rights...</b>

16:54.520 --> 16:57.840
<b>Now, be a good girl
and hand over those units--</b>

16:59.990 --> 17:04.140
<b>I can't... keep running any longer...</b>

17:04.140 --> 17:05.000
<b>I...</b>

17:17.000 --> 17:18.640
<b>Hurry! Quick!</b>

17:18.640 --> 17:20.990
<b>Shut up! I know, already!</b>

17:29.100 --> 17:33.840
<b><i>There was an unknown message
in the genetic code.</i></b>

17:33.840 --> 17:36.910
<b><i>When we converted it to text,
it turned out to be words.</i></b>

17:41.210 --> 17:42.470
<b>I'll always...</b>

17:44.050 --> 17:45.620
<b>love you too.</b>

17:50.660 --> 17:53.340
<b>All for the love of my precious child.</b>

17:54.830 --> 17:57.900
<b>A mother can be very strong, young lady.</b>

18:04.130 --> 18:05.520
<b>Mom!</b>

18:21.650 --> 18:23.160
<b>We have a signal!</b>

18:23.160 --> 18:25.330
<b>Permet link established.</b>

18:25.830 --> 18:27.640
<b><i>Commence calling.</i></b>

18:27.640 --> 18:28.500
<b><i>Roger.</i></b>

18:28.850 --> 18:31.730
<b>Now infiltrating
Quiet Zero's internal systems.</b>

18:40.760 --> 18:41.930
<b>Mom!</b>

18:41.930 --> 18:43.930
<b>Route everything to security!</b>

18:43.930 --> 18:45.820
<b>It's no use. There's too much.</b>

19:09.530 --> 19:10.790
<b>It stopped?</b>

19:11.330 --> 19:13.630
<b><i>The data storm has dissipated.</i></b>

19:13.980 --> 19:16.030
<b>Everyone is okay!</b>

19:16.870 --> 19:18.970
<b>Yes!</b>

19:18.970 --> 19:21.280
<b><i>Mission accomplished!</i></b>

19:25.170 --> 19:27.100
<b>You're not so good at killing people.</b>

19:27.630 --> 19:29.980
<b>Next time, try helping them instead.</b>

19:32.540 --> 19:34.610
<b>"Move forward, gain two."</b>

19:35.100 --> 19:37.210
<b>Those were your words, right?</b>

19:37.210 --> 19:39.880
<b>Then do as you say and move forward.</b>

19:40.480 --> 19:43.780
<b>You, Suletta, Ericht...</b>

19:44.160 --> 19:47.750
<b>All of us... will be family, after all.</b>

19:49.700 --> 19:53.000
<b><i>Quiet Zero has shut down.</i></b>

19:53.700 --> 19:56.380
<b><i>Now if you could please leave us...</i></b>

19:56.870 --> 19:58.420
<b><i>I'm afraid not.</i></b>

19:58.420 --> 20:04.490
<b>You and your companies
have grown far too big.</b>

20:06.680 --> 20:09.430
<b><i>Moving power transmission
preparation to Phase 5.</i></b>

20:09.430 --> 20:12.270
<b><i>Array setup within error range.</i></b>

20:12.270 --> 20:15.250
<b><i>Phase control systems, all green.</i></b>

20:16.390 --> 20:19.540
<b><i>Targeting data,
trajectory prediction complete.</i></b>

20:24.730 --> 20:27.340
<b><i>Interplanetary laser transmission system,</i></b>

20:27.340 --> 20:30.850
<b><i>commencing test firing at high output.</i></b>

20:39.670 --> 20:40.800
<b>No!</b>

20:50.150 --> 20:52.430
<b>Eri! Stop that!</b>

21:52.780 --> 21:54.260
<b>Everyone...?</b>

22:07.960 --> 22:09.610
<b>Eri!</b>

23:43.510 --> 23:46.360
<b><i>Next time on</i>
Mobile Suit Gundam the Witch from Mercury,</b>

23:44.710 --> 23:49.030
<b>Mobile Suit Gundam the Witch from Mercury</b>

23:46.360 --> 23:47.600
<b><i>the final episode.</i></b>

23:49.030 --> 23:52.250
<b>Illustration: Yana Toboso</b>
